{"seq":1,"slug":"gravitational-waves","title":"引力波探测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/gravitational-waves","wordCount":1301,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"引力波探测\">引力波探测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>引力波是时空本身的涟漪——爱因斯坦广义相对论预言的、以光速传播的时空度规扰动。当质量分布发生剧烈的非对称加速（如两个<a href=\"../compact-objects/black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>中的黑洞或两颗<a href=\"../compact-objects/neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>相互绕转并合）时，会向外辐射引力波。2015 年 LIGO 首次直接探测到双黑洞并合 GW150914，开启了引力波天文学这一全新观测窗口。</p>\n<p>与电磁波不同，引力波几乎不被物质吸收或散射，能直接携带致密天体最深处和最早期宇宙的信息，是与光子、<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>、<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>并列的第四类宇宙信使。它探测的是&quot;时空应变&quot;这一全新物理量，与本 hub 前述所有依赖电磁辐射的机制本质不同，因而能看见那些电磁波看不到的&quot;黑暗&quot;并合事件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[质量非对称加速] --&gt; B[时空度规扰动 h]&#10;  B --&gt; C[引力波以光速传播]&#10;  C --&gt; D{波源类型}&#10;  D --&gt;|双致密星并合| E[啁啾信号&lt;br/&gt;频率上扫]&#10;  D --&gt;|自转中子星| F[连续波&lt;br/&gt;近单频]&#10;  D --&gt;|超新星/早期宇宙| G[暴发/随机背景]&#10;  E --&gt; H[激光干涉测应变 h~10^-21]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[匹配滤波提取波形]&#10;  E --&gt; J[电磁/中微子对应体联测]\">flowchart TD\n  A[质量非对称加速] --&gt; B[时空度规扰动 h]\n  B --&gt; C[引力波以光速传播]\n  C --&gt; D{波源类型}\n  D --&gt;|双致密星并合| E[啁啾信号&lt;br/&gt;频率上扫]\n  D --&gt;|自转中子星| F[连续波&lt;br/&gt;近单频]\n  D --&gt;|超新星/早期宇宙| G[暴发/随机背景]\n  E --&gt; H[激光干涉测应变 h~10^-21]\n  F --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[匹配滤波提取波形]\n  E --&gt; J[电磁/中微子对应体联测]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波源类型</th>\n<th>信号特征</th>\n<th>探测手段</th>\n<th>代表事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双黑洞并合</td>\n<td>啁啾，秒级</td>\n<td>地面干涉仪</td>\n<td>GW150914</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双中子星并合</td>\n<td>啁啾，分钟级</td>\n<td>地面干涉仪</td>\n<td>GW170817</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超大质量双黑洞</td>\n<td>纳赫兹，年级</td>\n<td>脉冲星计时阵</td>\n<td>NANOGrav 信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续波</td>\n<td>近单频</td>\n<td>长时积分</td>\n<td>暂未确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"应变量与啁啾信号\">应变量与啁啾信号</h2><p>引力波的物理量是无量纲应变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，即它使两点间距离产生的相对变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta L/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。对一对绕转致密星，应变幅度约</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∼</mo><mfrac><mi>G</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h \\sim \\frac{G}{c^4}\\frac{\\ddot{Q}}{r} \\sim 10^{-21}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2832em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5972em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">21</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是质量四极矩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是源距离。这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-21}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">21</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 意味着把 4 公里长的干涉臂测出比质子直径还小千倍的长度变化——这正是<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/gw-observatories\">引力波天文台</a>需要极致工程精度的根源。</p>\n<p>双星并合的波形是一段&quot;啁啾&quot;：随着轨道收缩，频率和幅度同步上扬，最后在并合时刻达到峰值再衰减（铃宕）。波形演化由一个组合质量参量——啁啾质量主导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M} = \\frac{(m_1 m_2)^{3/5}}{(m_1+m_2)^{1/5}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.519em;vertical-align:-0.954em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>仅从啁啾的频率扫描速率就能直接读出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，这是引力波最干净的物理测量之一。波形提取靠匹配滤波：把数据与海量理论波形模板互相关，从远低于噪声的信号中&quot;拽&quot;出真信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标准汽笛与宇宙学\">标准汽笛与宇宙学</h2><p>引力波并合事件是天然的&quot;标准汽笛&quot;：波形的绝对幅度直接给出光度距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，无须像电磁天文学那样搭建一级级的距离阶梯。若同时通过电磁对应体测得红移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，就能独立测定哈勃常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>GW170817 正是这一方法的首秀：引力波给出距离，其<a href=\"../compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts\">伽马射线暴</a>对应体定位到宿主星系 NGC 4993 给出红移，由此得到一个完全独立于宇宙微波背景和超新星阶梯的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 测量。随着探测事件累积，标准汽笛有望对当前的&quot;哈勃张力&quot;给出仲裁。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测量方式</th>\n<th>距离来源</th>\n<th>红移来源</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超新星阶梯</td>\n<td>造父变星标定 SN Ia</td>\n<td>光谱</td>\n<td>样本大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMB</td>\n<td>早期宇宙模型</td>\n<td>直接</td>\n<td>高精度但模型依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准汽笛</td>\n<td>引力波波形</td>\n<td>电磁对应体</td>\n<td>不依赖距离阶梯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"频段-波源与多信使联动\">频段、波源与多信使联动</h2><p>引力波横跨极宽的频段，不同频段需要完全不同的探测器，对应不同的波源。地面干涉仪（10 Hz–几 kHz）擅长恒星级双星并合；脉冲星计时阵（纳赫兹）瞄准超大质量双黑洞——2023 年 NANOGrav 等团队报告了纳赫兹随机背景的证据，正是用<a href=\"../compact-objects/neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>中的毫秒脉冲星作天然时钟；空间干涉仪 LISA（毫赫兹，预计 2030 年代）将填补中间频段。</p>\n<p>引力波天文学的最大威力在于联动。双中子星并合同时辐射引力波、短<a href=\"../compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts\">伽马射线暴</a>、千新星光学/红外辉光，甚至可能的<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>。捕获这种多信使事件，需要引力波探测器在秒级发出预警、电磁望远镜在数小时内完成大天区搜寻——这套协同正是<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/joint-alerts\">多信使联合警报</a>网络要解决的核心问题。</p>\n<p>截至 2025 年 11 月，LIGO-Virgo-KAGRA 完成了为期约两年半的第四次观测运行（O4），实时报告了约 250 个候选信号，经分析第一阶段已确认 218 个置信事件，使引力波探测总数翻倍以上；第五次运行 O5 预计 2026 年下半年启动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>引力波是时空度规的涟漪，2015 年 GW150914 首探，是与光子、<a href=\"high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>、<a href=\"cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>并列的第四类信使。</li>\n<li>应变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\sim10^{-21}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">21</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极其微弱，对工程精度的极致要求是<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/gw-observatories\">引力波天文台</a>设计的出发点。</li>\n<li>啁啾质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 可从频率扫描速率直接读出；标准汽笛靠波形给出距离、电磁对应体给出红移，独立测定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>不同频段（地面干涉仪、脉冲星计时阵、LISA）对应不同波源，纳赫兹背景用<a href=\"../compact-objects/neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>作天然时钟。</li>\n<li>O4 已确认 218 个置信事件、总数翻倍，O5 预计 2026 下半年开启，多信使联动依赖<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/joint-alerts\">多信使联合警报</a>网络。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"引力波探测","id":"引力波探测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"应变量与啁啾信号","id":"应变量与啁啾信号"},{"level":2,"text":"标准汽笛与宇宙学","id":"标准汽笛与宇宙学"},{"level":2,"text":"频段、波源与多信使联动","id":"频段-波源与多信使联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"伽马射线暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts"},"next":{"title":"高能中微子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos"}}